@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:performance] horse-appearance-residency
An accepted appearance change on a locally controlled horse that replaces breed, tack, coat or mask
assets MUST release the old component references and request deferred engine collection with incremental
purging, so trying looks does not wait for the periodic pass. Appearance loading and movement prediction
MUST NOT collect inline. Remote horses, unchanged looks and colour-only changes MUST NOT request collection.
